  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Código ejemplokuna, JSON Esquemakuna, hinaspa makina ñawinchana política plantillakunaqa MIT Licencia ukhupi licenciasqam kanku, mana huk nisqa kaptinqa. Kikin sitioykipi libre desplegayta atinki.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Tinkusqa derechokunap yaykuna punkun",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Comercial Redistribución",
  "Commercial use": "Comercial usay",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "Comercial usayqa contactota munan",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Bletchley AI Safety Summit qhipata encargasqa, Yoshua Bengio pusasqan, patsak-ta yalliq expertokunawan kimsa chunka cercano llaqtakunamanta, UN, OECD, hinaspa EU-wan yapasqa, kay kikillanmanta informeqa kunan pacha científico pruebakunata tantan frontier IA capacidadkunamanta hinaspa riesgokunamanta — willaspa: wakin sistemakunaqa kunanqa evaluasqa kasqankuta reqsiyta atinku hinaspa comportamientonkuta chaymanhina cambiayta atinku, nispa.",
  "Companion media": "Yanapaq medioskuna",
